        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K540M Quaker Collection Single Cylinder Mortise Lockset  2-3/4\" Wide x 10\" High\r\n</b><p>\r\nThis plate, made popular during the Art Deco period circa 1910-1940, is actually a reproduction of the Russell & Erwin set shown in their catalog of 1897</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design, this latchset is made from cast brass. Can be paired with any of the 23 knobs or levers made by Brass Accents.  Includes matching mounting hardware for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Brass Accents D07-K539M Quaker Collection Latchset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>2-1/2\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 12</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
